    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a wacky adventure with 'Back To School', an arcade game set in a vibrant cartoon world. At the center of the game is a seemingly ordinary yellow bus that suddenly comes to life, defying gravity, physics and sometimes even common sense! Your mission? Tap continuously to chase the bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each failed attempt leads to an over-the-top cartoon death, with a fun repertoire of hilarious animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you are with your reflexes, the closer you will be to catching the bus. Challenge your friends to get the best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you fast enough to catch the craziest bus ever? Test your reflexes, embrace the chaos and prepare to laugh until you cry.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a wacky adventure with 'Back To School', an arcade game set in a vibrant cartoon world. At the center of the game is a seemingly ordinary yellow bus that suddenly comes to life, defying gravity, physics and sometimes even common sense! Your mission? Tap continuously to chase the bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each failed attempt leads to an over-the-top cartoon death, with a fun repertoire of hilarious animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you are with your reflexes, the closer you will be to catching the bus. Challenge your friends to get the best time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you fast enough to catch the craziest bus ever? Test your reflexes, embrace the chaos and prepare to laugh until you cry.</p>",
